      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ASTRO LEE (1) is first up since finishing sixth (24.45) in a Grade 4 at this track over 407m three months ago. Solid record here winning three races. Looks a key player drawing the cherry. BAHAMA BLUE (2) turned in a better run last time to find a minor placing (24.63) at this track behind Bargara Killian in a Mix 5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Comes through a solid form race last start. Expected to be in the finish again. PENNY DAZE (8) should enjoy clear running from the outside box. Below best latest at this track (24.39) when 8th and beaten 10 lengths. Has a strong winning record here at this journey including nine wins. Better than last start and can bounce back. CALAMITY CORNER (5) has ability and can feature with the right run after missing a cheque here most recently.",
